    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842880/extras/67d539a03a2bd3afdee0dc9c90c7998e.poster.avif?t=1753464425\" width=548 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842880/extras/67d539a03a2bd3afdee0dc9c90c7998e.webm?t=1753464425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842880/extras/67d539a03a2bd3afdee0dc9c90c7998e.mp4?t=1753464425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloudside Lane is a small casual building game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a tranquil  and comfortable environment, build houses and create your own cozy streetscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no scores or rules here, just follow your heart to create and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842880/extras/c815ea3a1544d1bf1453292edd8b45ef.poster.avif?t=1753464425\" width=548 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842880/extras/c815ea3a1544d1bf1453292edd8b45ef.webm?t=1753464425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842880/extras/c815ea3a1544d1bf1453292edd8b45ef.mp4?t=1753464425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Simple and pure building game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7No scores, no rules, no management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Start by building a house and meticulously craft a unique streetscape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Freely combine all kinds of components in your preferred way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Follow your imagination\uff0cpair walls , doors, windows, and roofs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Go with your gut\uff0carrange plants, decorations, and lighting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Admire your masterpiece at night or in the rain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Randomly selecting items may generate new inspiration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Relaxing vibe and cozy music let you play at your own pace</p>",
